hadiths[176]{hadithnumber,text}:
"648","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rifa'ah bin Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: Kaun si kamai pakeezah hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi ka apne hath ka kaam, aur har mubarak be'. Ise Bazzar ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"649","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Fath ke saal Makkah mein farmate suna: Beshak Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne sharab, murdar, khinzeer aur buton ki be' haram ki hai. To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Murdar ki charbi ke bare mein batayen, kyunke us se kashtiyan lipti jati hain, khalen chiknai jati hain aur log us se diye jalate hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, woh haram hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Allah Yahud ko halak kare; beshak Allah ne jab un par us ki charbi haram ki to unhon ne use pighlaya, phir becha aur us ki qeemat khai. Muttafaq alaih."
"650","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab do bechne wale ikhtilaf karen aur un ke darmiyan gawah na ho to baat woh hogi jo saman ka malik kahe ya donon tark karen. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"651","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kutte ki qeemat, fahisha ki ujrat aur kahin ki mithai se mana farmaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"652","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh apne ek thake hue unt par sawar the aur use chhorna chahte the. Unhon ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujh se mile aur mere liye dua ki aur use mara, to woh aisa chala jo kabhi na chala tha. Aap ne farmaya: Use mujhe ek ooqiya mein bech do. Main ne kaha: Nahin. Phir farmaya: Use mujhe bech do. To main ne use ek ooqiya mein becha aur apne ghar walon tak sawari ki shart lagayi; phir jab main pahuncha to unt lekar aaya aur unhon ne mujhe us ki qeemat naqd di, phir main wapas gaya to mere peeche bheja. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum samajhte ho ke main ne tum se tumhara unt lene ke liye mol-bhao kiya tha? Apna unt aur apne dirham lo, woh tumhara hai. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh riwayat Muslim ki hai."
"653","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke ham mein se ek aadmi ne apna ghulam apne marne ke baad aazad kiya jabke us ke paas us ke siwa maal na tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use bulaya aur bech diya. Muttafaq alaih."
"654","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja Hazrat Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek chuhiya ghee mein giri aur us mein mar gayi, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us ke bare mein poocha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use aur jo us ke gird hai phenk do aur khao. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad aur Nasai ne izafa kiya: Jame hue ghee mein."
"655","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab chuhiya ghee mein gire to agar jama hua ho to use aur jo us ke gird hai phenk do, aur agar patla ho to us ke qareeb na jao. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, magar Bukhari aur Abu Hatim ne is par wahm ka hukm lagaya."
"656","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke main ne Jabir se billi aur kutte ki qeemat ke bare mein poocha? To unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is se jhidka. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Nasai ne izafa kiya: Siwae shikari kutte ke."
"657","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke mere paas Barirah aain aur kaha: Main ne apne ghar walon se nau ooqiya par kitabat ki hai, har saal ek ooqiya, to meri madad karo. To main ne kaha: Agar tumhare ghar wale chahen ke main unhen gin kar dun aur tumhara wala mere liye ho to karun. To Barirah apne ghar walon ke paas gayin aur un se kaha to unhon ne inkar kiya. Phir woh un ke paas se aain jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baithe the. To unhon ne kaha: Main ne un par yeh pesh kiya to unhon ne siwae is ke inkar kiya ke wala unhi ke liye ho. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne suna aur Aishah ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Use lo aur un ke liye wala ki shart lagao, kyunke wala usi ke liye hai jo aazad kare. To Aishah ne aisa kiya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon mein khutba dene khade hue aur Allah ki hamd aur sana ki. Phir farmaya: Amma ba'd! Logon ka kya haal hai jo aisi sharten lagate hain jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki kitab mein nahin hain? Jo bhi shart Allah ki kitab mein nahin hai woh batil hai agarche sau sharten hon; Allah ka faisla ziyada haq hai, Allah ki shart ziyada mazboot hai; aur wala usi ke liye hai jo aazad kare. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Muslim ke han hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Use khareedo aur aazad karo aur un ke liye wala ki shart lagao."
"658","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar ne aulad wali bandiyon ki be' se mana kiya aur kaha: Na bechi jae, na hadiya ki jae, na wirasat mein li jae; woh faeda uthae jab tak chahe, phir jab woh mar jae to woh aazad hai. Ise Malik aur Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya, aur Baihaqi ne kaha: Ba'z rawiyon ne ise marfoo' kiya to wahm kiya."
"659","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham apni aulad wali bandiyan bechte the jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zinda the, ham is mein harj na samajhte the. Ise Nasai, Ibn Majah aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"660","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zaroorat se ziyada pani ki be' se mana farmaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur ek riwayat mein izafa kiya: Aur unt ke jima' ki be' se."
"661","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saannd ki jima' ki ujrat se mana farmaya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"662","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pet ke bachche ke bachche ki be' se mana farmaya; aur yeh woh be' thi jo Ahle Jahiliyah karte the: Aadmi unt khareedta is par ke untni bacha de, phir jo us ke pet mein hai woh bacha de. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"663","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wala ki be' aur us ke hadiye se mana farmaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"664","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kankari ki be' aur dhoke ki be' se mana farmaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"665","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khana khareede woh use na beche yahan tak ke naap le. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"666","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek be' mein do be'on se mana farmaya. Ise Ahmad aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha. Aur Abu Dawud ke han hai: Jo ek be' mein do be'en beche to us ke liye kam wali hai ya sood hai."
"667","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qarz aur be' halal nahin, na be' mein do sharten, na us nafe ka jo zamanat mein na aaya ho, aur na us ki be' jo tumhare paas na ho. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi, Ibn Khuzaimah aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha. Aur ise Uloom al-Hadees mein Abu Hanifah ki riwayat se mazkoor Amr se is lafz se nikala: Be' aur shart se mana kiya. Aur isi wajh se Tabarani ne ise Awsat mein nikala aur yeh ghareeb hai."
"668","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne urbun ki be' se mana farmaya. Ise Malik ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Amr bin Shu'aib se pahunchi hai."
"669","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne bazaar mein tel khareeda; phir jab main us ka mustahiq ho gaya to ek aadmi mujh se mila aur mujhe us par achcha nafa diya. To main ne aadmi ke hath par hath marna chaha to mere peeche se ek aadmi ne mera bazu pakda. To main palta to woh Zaid bin Sabit the. To unhon ne kaha: Use jahan khareeda hai wahan na becho yahan tak ke apne thikane le jao; kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke saman jahan khareeda jae wahan becha jae yahan tak ke tajir use apne thikanon le jaen. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Abu Dawud ke hain; aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"670","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main Baqi' mein bechta hun; to dinaron se bechta hun aur dirham leta hun, aur dirhamon se bechta hun aur dinar leta hun; is se leta hun aur use deta hun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us din ki qeemat se lene mein harj nahin hai jab tak tum juda na ho aur tumhare darmiyan kuch ho. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"671","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne najsh se mana farmaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"672","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muhaqalah, muzabanah, mukhabarah aur istisna se mana farmaya siwae is ke ke ma'loom ho. Ise Khamsa ne Ibn Majah ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"673","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muhaqalah, mukhadarah, mulamasah, munabazah aur muzabanah se mana farmaya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"674","[AI-translation] Hazrat Taus se Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sawaron se aage milne na jao, aur shehri dehati ke liye na beche. Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Us ke qaul 'shehri dehati ke liye na beche' ka kya ma'na hai? Unhon ne kaha: Us ka dallal na bane. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"675","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tijarti qafilon se aage milne na jao; phir jis se mil kar khareeda gaya, phir jab us ka malik bazaar aae to use ikhtiyar hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"676","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke shehri dehati ke liye beche; aur farmaya: Najsh na karo, aadmi apne bhai ki be' par be' na kare, apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje, aur aurat apni bahan ki talaq na mange taake us ke bartan mein jo hai undel le. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai: Musalman Musalman ke mol par mol na kare."
"677","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo walidah aur us ke bachche ke darmiyan judai kare Allah qayamat ke din us ke aur us ke pyaron ke darmiyan judai karega. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha, lekin is ki sanad mein kalaam hai; aur is ka shahid hai."
"678","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke do bhai ghulam bechun; to main ne unhen becha aur un donon ke darmiyan judai ki. Phir main ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya to Aap ne farmaya: Un donon ko pao aur wapas lo, aur unhen siwae jama ke na becho. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain; aur Ibn Khuzaimah, Ibn Jarud, Ibn Hibban, Hakim, Tabarani aur Ibn Qattan ne ise sahih kaha."
"679","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Madinah mein mehangai ho gayi to logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mehangai ho gayi hai to hamare liye rate muqarrar kar den. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah hi rate muqarrar karne wala, rokne wala, kushada karne wala aur rizq dene wala hai; aur beshak main ummeed rakhta hun ke Allah Ta'ala se is haal mein milun ke tum mein se koi mujh se khoon ya maal mein zulm na mange. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"680","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ma'mar bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Zakhira sirf gunahgar karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"681","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Untniyon aur bakriyon ke than na bandho; phir jo unhen is ke baad khareede woh dohne ke baad do behtar rayon mein hai: agar chahe rakhe, aur agar chahe wapas kare aur khajur ka ek sa' de. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai: To use teen din ikhtiyar hai. Aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai jise Bukhari ne ta'liqan zikr kiya: Us ke sath khane ka ek sa' wapas kare, safed gehn nahin. Bukhari ne kaha: Aur khajur ziyada hai."
"682","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jo doodh roki hui bakri khareede aur use wapas kare to us ke sath ek sa' wapas kare. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Ismaili ne izafa kiya: Khajur mein se."
"683","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khane ke dher par se guzre aur apna hath us mein dala to ungliyon ko tari lagi. To Aap ne farmaya: Aey khane ke malik! Yeh kya hai? Us ne kaha: Use barish pahunchi hai Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne use khane ke upar na rakha taake log use dekhen? Jo dhoka de woh mujh se nahin hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"684","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraidah apne walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo angoor ko katayi ke dinon mein roke rakhe yahan tak ke use us ko beche jo us se sharab banae woh dekh bhal kar aag mein kooda. Ise Tabarani ne Awsat mein hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"685","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aamdani zamanat se hai. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya; aur Bukhari aur Abu Dawud ne ise za'if kaha; aur Tirmidhi, Ibn Khuzaimah, Ibn Jarud, Ibn Hibban, Hakim aur Ibn Qattan ne ise sahih kaha."
"686","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwah Bariqi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen ek dinar diya taake us se qurbani ya bakri khareeden; to unhon ne do bakriyan khareedin aur un mein se ek dinar mein bech di; phir Aap ke paas bakri aur dinar lae. To Aap ne un ke liye un ki be' mein barkat ki dua ki; to woh agar mitti khareedte to us mein nafa pate. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya; aur Bukhari ne ise ek hadees ke zimn mein nikala magar us ke alfaz na lae; aur Tirmidhi ne is ka shahid Hakim bin Hizam ki hadees se zikr kiya."
"687","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke janwaron ke peton mein jo hai use khareeda jae yahan tak ke janen, aur jo un ke thanon mein hai use becha jae, aur bhage hue ghulam ko khareeda jae, aur maal ghanimat ko taqseem se pahle khareeda jae, aur sadqon ko qabze se pahle khareeda jae, aur gota-khor ki chot se. Ise Ibn Majah, Bazzar aur Daraqutni ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"688","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pani mein machhli na khareedo kyunke yeh dhoka hai. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur ishara kiya ke sahih is ka mauqoof hona hai."
"689","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke phal becha jae yahan tak ke khaya jae, aur oon peeth par na bechi jae, aur doodh than mein na becha jae. Ise Tabarani ne Awsat mein aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ne ise Maraseel mein Ikrimah se nikala, aur yahi rajeh hai; aur ise Ibn Abbas par mauqoofan bhi qawi sanad se nikala, aur Baihaqi ne ise tarjeeh di."
"690","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mazameen aur malaqeeh ki be' se mana farmaya. Ise Bazzar ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"691","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman ki be' ko khatm kare Allah us ki laghzish ko khatm karega. Ise Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"692","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab do aadmi be' karen to un mein se har ek ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak juda na hon aur jama hon, ya un mein se ek doosre ko ikhtiyar de; phir agar un mein se ek doosre ko ikhtiyar de aur is par be' karen to be' wajib ho gayi; aur agar be' ke baad juda hon aur un mein se koi be' na chhore to be' wajib ho gayi. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"693","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bechne wala aur khareedne wala juda hone tak ikhtiyar rakhte hain siwae is ke ke ikhtiyar ki be' ho; aur us ke liye halal nahin ke is khauf se juda ho ke woh use wapas mange. Ise Khamsa ne Ibn Majah ke siwa, aur Daraqutni, Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Jarud ne riwayat kiya. Aur ek riwayat mein hai: Yahan tak ke apni jagah se juda hon."
"694","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr kiya ke use be'on mein dhoka diya jata hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum be' karo to kaho: Dhoka nahin hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"695","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sood khane wale, khilane wale, likhne wale aur us ke do gawahon par la'nat ki, aur farmaya: Woh barabar hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Bukhari ke han Abu Juhaifah ki hadees se isi tarah hai."
"696","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Sood tahattar darwaze hai, us ka aasan tareen jaise ke aadmi apni walidah se nikah kare; aur beshak badtareen sood Musalman aadmi ki izzat hai. Ise Ibn Majah ne mukhtasar riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne poori aur ise sahih kaha."
"697","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se na becho siwae barabar ke, aur ek ko doosre par ziyada na karo; aur chandi chandi se na becho siwae barabar ke, aur ek ko doosre par ziyada na karo; aur un mein se ghaib ko hazir se na becho. Muttafaq alaih."
"698","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se, chandi chandi se, gehn gehn se, jau jau se, khajur khajur se, namak namak se; barabar, ek jaisa, hath se hath; phir jab yeh qismen mukhtalif hon to jaise chaho becho jab hath se hath ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"699","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se wazan se wazan barabar, aur chandi chandi se wazan se wazan barabar; phir jo ziyada de ya ziyada le woh sood hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"700","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id aur Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar par ek aadmi ko aamil banaya to woh Aap ke paas achchi khajur laya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya Khaibar ki sari khajur aisi hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham is mein se ek sa' do ya teen sa' se lete hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na karo; mili hui ko dirhamon se becho, phir dirhamon se achchi khareedo. Aur mizaan mein isi tarah farmaya. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai: Aur mizaan bhi isi tarah hai."
"701","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajur ke dher ki be' se mana farmaya jis ka naap ma'loom na ho, ma'loom naap ki khajur se. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"702","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ma'mar bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate sunta tha: Khana khane se barabar hai. Aur hamara khana us din jau tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"703","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fudalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Khaibar ke din barah dinar mein haar khareeda jis mein sona aur moti the; to main ne use alag kiya aur us mein barah dinar se ziyada paya. To main ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya to Aap ne farmaya: Jab tak alag na ho na becha jae. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"704","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne janwar ki janwar se udhar be' se mana farmaya. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Jarud ne ise sahih kaha."
"705","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab tum eenah se be' karo, gae ki dum pakad lo, kheti par razi ho jao aur jihad chhor do to Allah tum par zillat musallat kar dega jo us waqt tak na hatayega jab tak tum apne deen ki taraf wapas na aao. Ise Abu Dawud ne Nafi' se un ki riwayat se riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein kalaam hai; aur Ahmad ke han Ata ki riwayat se isi tarah hai, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain; aur Ibn Qattan ne ise sahih kaha."
"706","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ke liye sifarish kare aur woh use hadiya de aur use qabool kare to woh sood ke bade darwazon mein se ek darwaze par aaya hai. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein kalaam hai."
"707","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rishwat dene wale aur lene wale par la'nat ki. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"708","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke lashkar tayyar karen to unt khatm ho gae; to unhen hukm diya ke sadqe ki jawan untniyon par len. Unhon ne kaha: To main sadqe ke unton tak ek unt ke badle do unt leta tha. Ise Hakim aur Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"709","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabanah se mana farmaya ke apne bagh ka phal beche agar khajur ho to khajur se naap kar, aur agar angoor ho to use kishmish se naap kar beche, aur agar kheti ho to use khane ke naap se beche; in sab se mana farmaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"710","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko taza khajur ke khushk khajur se khareedne ke bare mein poochte suna. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya taza khajur sookhne par kam hoti hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. To Aap ne is se mana farmaya. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Madini, Tirmidhi, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"711","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kali' ki kali' se be' se mana farmaya, yani qarz ki qarz se. Ise Ishaq aur Bazzar ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"712","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne araya mein ruksat di ke un ke andaze se naap kar bechi jaen. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai ke ariyah mein ruksat di jise ghar wale apne andaze se khajur lekar len aur use taza khaen."
"713","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne araya ki be' mein un ke andaze se ruksat di paanch wasq se kam mein ya paanch wasq mein. Muttafaq alaih."
"714","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ki be' se mana farmaya yahan tak ke un ki durusti zahir ho jae; bechne wale aur khareedne wale donon ko mana farmaya. Muttafaq alaih; aur ek riwayat mein hai ke jab un ki durusti ke bare mein poocha jata to farmate: Yahan tak ke us ki aafat chali jae."
"715","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ki be' se mana farmaya yahan tak ke woh pak jaen. Kaha gaya: Un ka pakna kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Surkh aur peele hon. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"716","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne angoor ki be' se mana farmaya yahan tak ke siyah ho jae, aur dane ki be' se yahan tak ke sakht ho jae. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"717","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum apne bhai ko phal becho aur use aafat pahunch jae to tumhare liye halal nahin ke us se kuch lo. Tum apne bhai ka maal na-haq kyun lete ho? Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aafaton ke mu'af karne ka hukm diya."
"718","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo khajur ke darakht khareede us ke baad ke un ki peewandkari ho chuki ho to us ka phal bechne wale ka hai jis ne use becha siwae is ke ke khareedne wala shart lagae. Muttafaq alaih."
"719","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef lae jabke woh phalon mein ek saal aur do saal ki salaf karte the. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo khajur mein salaf kare woh ma'loom naap, ma'loom wazan aur ma'loom muddat tak salaf kare. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ke han hai: Jo kisi cheez mein salaf kare."
"720","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Abza aur Abdullah bin Abi Awfa (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath maal ghanimat pate the, aur hamare paas Sham ke nabti aate to ham unhen gehn, jau aur kishmish mein salaf dete. Aur ek riwayat mein hai: Aur tel muqarrar muddat tak. Kaha gaya: Kya un ki kheti thi? Unhon ne kaha: Ham un se is ke bare mein na poochte the. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"721","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo logon ke maal ada karne ka irada rakh kar le Allah us ki taraf se ada karta hai; aur jo use tabaah karne ka irada rakh kar le Allah use tabaah karta hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"722","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak falan ke paas Sham se kapda aaya hai, to agar Aap us ke paas bhejen aur us se kushadgi tak udhar par do kapde le len? To Aap ne us ke paas bheja magar us ne inkar kiya. Ise Hakim aur Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"723","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Peeth sawari ke kharch se sawari ki jati hai jab girwi ho, aur doodh wali ka doodh piya jata hai us ke kharch se jab girwi ho; aur jo sawar ho aur piye us par kharch hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"724","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Girwi apne malik se band nahin hoti jis ne use girwi rakha; us ka nafa us ke liye hai aur us ka nuqsan us par hai. Ise Daraqutni aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain; magar Abu Dawud aur ghair ke han mahfooz is ka mursal hona hai."
"725","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Rafi' se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi se jawan unt qarz liya; phir Aap ke paas sadqe ke unt aae to Abu Rafi' ko hukm diya ke aadmi ka jawan unt ada karen. To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe siwae umdah ke nahin milta. Aap ne farmaya: Use do, kyunke logon ke behtareen woh hain jo ada karne mein sab se achche hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"726","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har qarz jo nafa kheenche woh sood hai. Ise Haris bin Abi Usamah ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad giri hui hai; aur is ka ek za'if shahid Fudalah bin Ubaid se Baihaqi ke han hai; aur doosra Abdullah bin Salam (Raziyallahu anhu) se mauqoof Bukhari ke han hai."
"727","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo apna maal ba-ainihi us aadmi ke paas pae jo muflis ho gaya ho to woh ghair se us ka ziyada haqdar hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur Abu Dawud aur Malik ne ise Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ki mursal riwayat se is lafz se riwayat kiya: Jo bhi aadmi saman beche phir jis ne khareeda woh muflis ho jae aur jis ne becha us ne us ki qeemat mein se kuch na paya ho aur apna saman ba-ainihi pa le to woh us ka ziyada haqdar hai; aur agar khareedne wala mar jae to saman ka malik qarz-daron jaisa hai. Aur Baihaqi ne ise mausul kiya aur Abu Dawud ki pairwi mein ise za'if kaha; aur Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne Umar bin Khaldah ki riwayat se riwayat kiya ke unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Hurairah ke paas apne ek sathi ke bare mein aae jo muflis ho gaya tha, to unhon ne kaha: Main tumhare darmiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke faisle se faisla karunga: Jo muflis ho jae ya mar jae aur koi aadmi apna saman ba-ainihi pa le to woh us ka ziyada haqdar hai. Aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha, aur Abu Dawud ne maut ke zikr ki is ziyadti ko za'if kaha."
"728","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shuraid apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maaldar ka tal-matol us ki izzat aur saza ko halal karta hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Bukhari ne ise ta'liqan zikr kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"729","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek aadmi ko un phalon mein nuqsan pahuncha jo us ne khareede the, to us ka qarz badh gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us par sadqa karo. To logon ne us par sadqa kiya magar woh us ke qarz ki adayegi ko na pahuncha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke qarz-daron se farmaya: Jo pao le lo, aur tumhare liye siwae is ke kuch nahin hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"730","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Malik ke bete apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'az ke maal par pabandi lagai aur use us ke qarz mein becha. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Abu Dawud ne ise mursal nikala, aur is ke mursal hone ko tarjeeh di gayi."
"731","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main Uhud ke din Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne pesh kiya gaya jabke main chaudah saal ka tha to mujhe ijazat na di; aur Khandaq ke din pesh kiya gaya jabke main pandrah saal ka tha to mujhe ijazat di. Muttafaq alaih; aur Baihaqi ki ek riwayat mein hai: To mujhe ijazat na di aur mujhe baligh na samjha. Aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"732","[AI-translation] Hazrat Atiyyah Qurazi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne Quraizah ke din pesh kiye gae; to jo baligh tha qatl kiya gaya aur jo baligh na tha use chhor diya gaya. To main un mein tha jo baligh na the aur mujhe chhor diya gaya. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur kaha ke Shaikhain ki shart par sahih hai."
"733","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat ke liye atiyah jaez nahin siwae us ke shauhar ki ijazat ke. Aur ek lafz mein hai: Aurat ke liye apne maal mein faisla jaez nahin hai jab us ka shauhar us ki ismat ka malik ho. Ise Ahmad aur Sunan walon ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"734","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qabisah bin Mukhariq Hilali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mangna siwae teen mein se ek ke halal nahin hai: woh aadmi jis ne zamanat uthai to us ke liye mangna halal hai yahan tak ke use pa le phir rok jae; aur woh aadmi jise aafat pahunchi jis ne us ka maal tabaah kar diya to us ke liye mangna halal hai yahan tak ke guzare ka sahara pa le; aur woh aadmi jise faqa pahunchi yahan tak ke us ki qaum ke aqalmandon mein se teen kahen ke falan ko faqa pahunchi hai to us ke liye mangna halal hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"735","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Awf Muzani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sulah Musalmanon ke darmiyan jaez hai siwae us sulah ke jo halal ko haram kare ya haram ko halal kare; aur Musalman apni sharton par hain siwae us shart ke jo halal ko haram kare ya haram ko halal kare. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise sahih kaha; magar un par inkar kiya gaya kyunke is ka rawi Kaseer bin Abdullah bin Amr bin Awf za'if hai; aur goya unhon ne use kasrat turuq se mo'tabar samjha; aur Ibn Hibban ne ise Abu Hurairah ki hadees se sahih kaha."
"736","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padosi apne padosi ko apni deewar mein lakdi gadne se na roke. Phir Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhen is se munh mode hue dekhta hun? Allah ki qasam main use tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan phenkunga. Muttafaq alaih."
"737","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Humaid Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi aadmi ke liye halal nahin ke apne bhai ki lathi us ke dil ki khushi ke baghair le. Ise Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne apne Sahihain mein riwayat kiya."
"738","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maaldar ka tal-matol zulm hai; aur jab tum mein se kisi ko maaldar par hawala kiya jae to hawala qabool kare. Muttafaq alaih; aur Ahmad ki riwayat mein hai: Aur jise hawala diya jae woh hawala le."
"739","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham mein se ek aadmi ka inteqal ho gaya to ham ne use ghusl diya, khushbu lagai aur kafnaya; phir ham use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lae aur ham ne kaha: Kya Aap us par namaz padhenge? To Aap chand qadam chale, phir farmaya: Kya us par qarz hai? Ham ne kaha: Do dinar. To Aap wapas hue aur Abu Qatadah ne unhen apne zimme liya. Phir ham Aap ke paas aae to Abu Qatadah ne kaha: Do dinar mujh par hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya qarz-dar ka haq pakka ho gaya aur maiyyat un donon se bari ho gayi? Unhon ne kaha: Han. To Aap ne us par namaz padhi. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"740","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas qarz-dar maiyyat laya jata to poochte: Kya us ne apne qarz ki adayegi chhodi hai? Phir agar bataya jata ke us ne wafa chhodi hai to us par namaz padhte, warna farmate: Apne sathi par namaz padho. Phir jab Allah ne Aap par futoohat kholin to farmaya: Main mu'minon ka un ki janon se ziyada haqdar hun; to jo mar jae jabke us par qarz ho to us ki adayegi mujh par hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ki ek riwayat mein hai: To jo mar jae aur wafa na chhore."
"741","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hadd mein kafalat nahin hai. Ise Baihaqi ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"742","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Main do shareekon ka teesra hun jab tak un mein se ek apne sathi se khayanat na kare; phir jab khayanat kare to main un donon ke darmiyan se nikal jata hun. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"743","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'ib bin Yazid Makhzumi se riwayat hai ke woh Nabuwat se pahle Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke shareek the; phir Fath ke din aae to Aap ne farmaya: Mere bhai aur shareek ko khush aamdeed. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"744","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main, Ammar aur Sa'd Badr ke din jo pate us mein shareek hue... Al-hadees. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"745","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Khaibar nikalne ka irada kiya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum Khaibar mein mere wakeel ke paas aao to us se pandrah wasq lo. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur ise sahih kaha."
"746","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwah Bariqi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen dinar dekar bheja taake Aap ke liye qurbani khareeden... Al-hadees. Ise Bukhari ne ek hadees ke darmiyan riwayat kiya, aur yeh guzar chuki hai."
"747","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar ko sadqe par bheja... Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih."
"748","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tirsath qurbaniyan kin aur Ali ko hukm diya ke baqi zabah karen... Al-hadees. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"749","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Useef ke qisse mein riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Unais! Is ki aurat ke paas subah jao; phir agar iqrar kare to use rajm karo... Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih."
"750","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haq kaho agarche kadwa ho. Ise Ibn Hibban ne ek taweel hadees mein sahih kaha."
"751","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hath par hai jo us ne liya yahan tak ke use ada kare. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"752","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amanat us ko ada karo jis ne tumhen ameen banaya, aur us se khayanat na karo jis ne tum se khayanat ki. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha; aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Abu Hatim Razi ne ise munkar kaha."
"753","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ya'la bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab mere qasid tumhare paas aaen to unhen tees zirahen do. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya zamanat wali aariyat ya ada ki jane wali aariyat? Aap ne farmaya: Balke ada ki jane wali aariyat. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"754","[AI-translation] Hazrat Safwan bin Umayyah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hunain ke din un se zirahen aariyat lin. To unhon ne kaha: Aey Muhammad! Ghasb hai? Aap ne farmaya: Balke zamanat wali aariyat hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ka ek za'if shahid Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se nikala."
"755","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo zameen se ek balisht zulm se kaate Allah qayamat ke din use saat zameenon se us ka tauq pehnaega. Muttafaq alaih."
"756","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni kisi biwi ke paas the to Ummahat al-Mu'minin mein se ek ne apne khadim ke sath pyala bheja jis mein khana tha; to pyala toot gaya. To Aap ne use joda aur us mein khana rakha. Aur farmaya: Khao. Aur sahih pyala qasid ko de diya aur toota hua rok liya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi ne, aur marne wali ka naam Aishah bataya, aur izafa kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khana khane se aur bartan bartan se. Aur ise sahih kaha."
"757","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaum ki zameen mein un ki ijazat ke baghair kheti kare us ke liye kheti mein se kuch nahin hai, aur us ke liye us ka kharch hai. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha; aur kaha jata hai ke Bukhari ne ise za'if kaha."
"758","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwah bin Zubair se riwayat hai ke sahaba mein se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Do aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek zameen mein jhagadte hue aae jis mein ek ne khajur ke darakht lagaye the jabke zameen doosre ki thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zameen ka faisla us ke malik ke haq mein kiya aur darakht wale ko hukm diya ke apne darakht nikale. Aur farmaya: Zalim jad ke liye haq nahin hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad hasan hai; aur is ka aakhir Sunan walon ke han Urwah ki Sa'id bin Zaid se riwayat se hai; aur is ke mausul aur mursal hone mein ikhtilaf hua, aur us ke sahabi ke ta'ayyun mein."
"759","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mina mein Qurbani ke din apne khutbe mein farmaya: Beshak tumhare khoon aur tumhare maal [aur tumhari izzaten] tum par haram hain jaise tumhare is din ki hurmat hai, tumhare is sheher mein, tumhare is mahine mein. Muttafaq alaih."
"760","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne shuf'ah ka faisla us cheez mein kiya jo taqseem na hui ho. Ise Ahmad aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"761","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padosi apne sehan ka ziyada haqdar hai. Ise Bazzar ne riwayat kiya."
"762","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghar ka padosi ghar ka ziyada haqdar hai. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"763","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padosi apne padosi ki shuf'ah ka ziyada haqdar hai, us ka intezar kiya jaega agarche woh ghaib ho. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."
"764","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Shuf'ah rassi kholne jaisa hai. Ise Bazzar ne riwayat kiya."
"765","[AI-translation] Hazrat Suhaib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen mein barkat hai: muddat tak be', muqarabah aur jau ko gehn se milana ghar ke liye, bazaar ke liye nahin. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"766","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh aadmi par shart lagate jab use muqarabah maal dete ke use khushki mein na le jae. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"767","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Khaibar se aadhi paidawar par mu'amala kiya. Muttafaq alaih."
"768","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hanzalah bin Qais se riwayat hai ke main ne Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) se sona chandi se zameen kiraya par lene ke bare mein poocha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"769","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sabit bin Dahhak (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzara'at se mana farmaya aur hukm diya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"770","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae aur pichhne lagane wale ko ujrat di. Muttafaq alaih."
"771","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pichhne lagane wale ki kamai khabees hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"772","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Teen hain jin ka main qayamat ke din muqabil hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"773","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jis par tum ujrat lete ho us mein sab se haq dam karna hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"774","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mazdoor ko us ki ujrat us ke paseene khushk hone se pahle do. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"775","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mazdoor rakhe woh use us ki ujrat batae. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya."
"776","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwah se Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo banjar zameen aabad kare woh us ki hai. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya."
"777","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo murda zameen zinda kare woh us ki hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"778","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Sa'b bin Jassamah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hima Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke liye hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"779","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na nuqsan hai na nuqsan pahunchana. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"780","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo zameen par deewar ghere woh us ki hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"781","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kunwan khode woh us ka hai. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya."
"782","[AI-translation] Hazrat Alqamah bin Wa'il apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen Hazramaut mein zameen qata' karke di. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"783","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zubair ko un ke ghode ki daud ke barabar zameen qata' karke di. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"784","[AI-translation] Sahaba mein se ek aadmi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ghazwa kiya aur Aap ko farmate suna. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."
"785","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab insan mar jae to us ka amal kat jata hai siwae teen ke. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"786","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar ne Khaibar mein zameen pai to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"787","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar ko sadqe par bheja... Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih."
"788","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un ke walid unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lae aur kaha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"789","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne hadiye mein wapas lene wala kutte ki tarah hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"790","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar aur Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Kisi aadmi ke liye halal nahin ke atiyah dekar wapas le. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."
"791","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hadiya qabool farmate aur us ka badla dete. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"792","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko untni hadiya ki to Aap ne use badla diya. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."
"793","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umra usi ke liye hai jise di gayi ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"794","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Allah ke raste mein ghode par sawari karai to us ke malik ne use zaya kiya; to main ne gumaan kiya ke woh use bechne wala hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"795","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Hadya do mohabbat karo. Ise Bukhari ne Adab al-Mufrad mein riwayat kiya."
"796","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hadya do kyunke hadiya seena kheenchta hai. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya."
"797","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Musalman aurton! Padosan padosan ko haqeer na samjhe. Muttafaq alaih."
"798","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo hadiya de woh us ka ziyada haqdar hai. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"799","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raste mein khajur ke paas se guzre aur farmaya: Agar mujhe khauf na hota ke... Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"800","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se giri hui cheez ke bare mein poocha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"801","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo gumshuda ko panah de woh gumrah hai jab tak us ka elan na kare. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"802","[AI-translation] Hazrat Iyaz bin Himar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo luqtah pae woh gawah banae. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"803","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Usman Taimi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne haji ke luqtah se mana farmaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"804","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar! Zabah karda halal nahin hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"805","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Faraez ko un ke walon se milao. Muttafaq alaih."
"806","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman kafir ka waris nahin hota. Muttafaq alaih."
"807","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se beti, pote ki beti aur bahan ke bare mein riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya: Beti ke liye aadha hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"808","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do mukhtalif deen wale wirasat nahin pate. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."
"809","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mere pote ka beta mar gaya hai, to mera kya hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"810","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Buraidah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dadi ke liye chhata hissa muqarrar farmaya jab us ke siwa koi na ho. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"811","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mamun waris hai us ka jis ka koi waris na ho. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."
"812","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah bin Sahl se riwayat hai ke Umar ne mere sath Abu Ubaidah (Raziyallahu anhum) ko likha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"813","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab bachcha chillate hue paida ho to waris hota hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"814","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qatil ke liye kuch nahin hai. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"815","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo wali bachae. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"816","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wala gosht ki tarah hai. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"817","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qilabah se Anas se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein sab se bada farz janne wala Zaid bin Sabit hai. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."
"818","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman aadmi ka haq nahin hai jis ke paas wasiyat ki cheez ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"819","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main maal wala hun aur meri siwae beti ke koi waris nahin hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"820","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri walidah achanak mar gayin hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"821","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah Bahili (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak Allah ne har haq wale ko us ka haq diya hai. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."
"822","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tum par tahai se sadqa kiya hai. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"823","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se, woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo amanat rakhi jae us par zamanat nahin hai. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya."
